%H A402155 V. B. Priezzhev, Deepak Dhar, Abhishek Dhar and Supriya Krishnamurthy, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/9611019">Eulerian walkers as a model of self-organized criticality</a>, arXiv:cond-mat/9611019, 1996; Phys. Rev. Lett. 77 (1996), 5079-5082.
